Creative coloring games for kids will help your child learn more about colors and coloring itself. Let your child become a real artist and develop new talents. Coloring book for kids includes coloring activity which is friendly to the youngest and focuses on different objects that are surrounding kids everyday. Furthermore, these games for kids contain a lot of coloring tools that will entertain your child with fascinating sounds and funny animations. The following is waiting for you:

- 9 topic packs with 144 coloring pages;
- Easy coloring book for kids;
- Different coloring tools for customizing;
- Creativity development.

Games for girls and boys are designed for children of preschool age and also suitable as games for toddlers of 2- 4 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational games for girls and boys as fine motor skills and logic development. Enjoy!

1. Knowledge in Life：
- Ten daily life topics include: Transportation, Animals, Nature, Community, Health and Hygiene, School, Go Green, Food, Self and Family, People who help us;
- Children have access to diverse topics according to their interests and age;
- Provides activities, worksheets and project exploration.


2. School-Based Curriculum：
- Exclusive for School Users;
- A Multi-media Learning Platform for schools;
- Easy for schools to organise learning topics;
- Allows parents and children to review learning progress in school.


3. Origin of Chinese characters：
- Selects 52 of the most frequently-used characters in kindergarten;
- Introduces strokes, pronunciation and the evolution of characters with fun animations;
- Provides word-matching games.


4. Festival：
- Different animated stories including Christmas, Lunar New Year and Mid-Autumn Festival etc.;
- Allows children to gain better understanding of different festivals.


5. Language (Chinese)：
- Handpicks 90 animated stories about the language according to ten daily life topic for K1-K3 children;
- Introduces new words and sentence structures;
- Enhances children’s language ability.


6. Explore 360:
- New animations updated every week;
- Provides Cantonese, Putonghua and English versions;
- Contents are fun, informative and engaging;
- Includes topics related to children’s daily lives and moral education.


(Visitor Users may upgrade to become Subscribed Member through the Apple In-App-Purchase Subscription)

Creative and educational game for children that will help your child spend time with an electronic device effectively. Let your kid feel like a real artist and develop logic skills at the same time. The app includes coloring which is friendly to the youngest and puzzle solving tasks with educational element. Also, the app contains pictures on different topics which will entertain your child with fascinating sounds and funny characters. The following is waiting for you:

- 8 topic packs with 96 puzzles;
- Easy coloring for children;
- Educational puzzles;
- Cute animation in the end of each task.

The app is designed for children of preschool age and also suitable for boys and girls 2- 5 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational elements as developing of fine motor skills and logic. Have fun!

Welcome to Little Panda's Farm! Here, you can grow crops, raise small animals, process and sell agricultural products, renovate buildings, expand your farm and enjoy the nature. 

What are you waiting for? Join busy farm life! 

RENOVATING THE BUILIDING
The building on the farm is a bit dilapidated. Let's renovate it first! Construction workers will help you rebuild it! The yard is still a bit messy. Let's clean it up! Pull out the weeds and cut down the dead trees to make the yard tidy!

GROWING CROPS
There are many kinds of seeds in the farm: apples, radishes, sunflowers, and more. Please bury them in the soil, and offer them enough sunlight and water. Remember to give them fertilizer on time, and drive away greedy insects and birds time to time. 

RAISING ANIMALS
The farm animals are waiting for your care. Feed the cows and bunnies with hay, give the sheep a bath, and clean the hen's house. Let those little animals grow up gradually. Now, you can head to the beehives and fish ponds to take care of other farm animals. 

PROCESSING & SELLING
Ding-dong! You've received a new order! Drive the transport truck and deliver the goods! For every order you complete, you will unlock a new product processing method! Produce more new goods to attract more customers!

The farm is making more and more money. Awesome! Hurry up and buy your favorite decorations to build a farm of your own! 

FEATURES: 
- Experience farm life with role play as farmers;
- Adorable farm animals: cows, sheep, hens, bees, fish and rabbits;
- Grow fruits and vegetables: apples, dragon fruits, oranges, wheat, corn, and more;
- Harvest & process 40+ farm produce;
- The processing formula allows you to make delicious food easily;
- Sell farm products. Learn management of the farm and money;
- Renovate buildings, buy decorations to build a farm of your own;
- Login every day to get mystery gifts.
